103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":664249962,"text":"Huh!? Wait, you're Shenhe! This is a surprise!","nextNodeIds":[705090104]},{"nodeId":705090104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1045,"speakerName":"Shenhe","textMapHash":4001105498,"text":"This place isn't easy to find. Angel's Share... The name doesn't exactly roll off the tongue.","nextNodeIds":[705090105]},{"nodeId":705090105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1045,"speakerName":"Shenhe","textMapHash":994901282,"text":"Mr. Zhongli was kind enough to help me with directions. I'm thankful.","nextNodeIds":[705090106]},{"nodeId":705090106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3525174114,"text":"You needed help with directions?... Wait, you came all this way just for a drink?","nextNodeIds":[705090107]},{"nodeId":705090107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1045,"speakerName":"Shenhe","textMapHash":115739690,"text":"That's right.","nextNodeIds":[705090108]},{"nodeId":705090108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1045,"speakerName":"Shenhe","textMapHash":2001739170,"text":"Because... we're friends.","nextNodeIds":[705090109]},{"nodeId":705090109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":57772098,"text":"What would you like?","nextNodeIds":[705090110]},{"nodeId":705090110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":92911354,"text":"Here's the menu!","nextNodeIds":[705090111]},{"nodeId":705090111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1045,"speakerName":"Shenhe","textMapHash":1447054738,"text":"Boreal Watch... Hmm, Boreal? As in a cold climate?","nextNodeIds":[705090112]},{"nodeId":705090112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3299801802,"text":"Well, Boreal Watch here probably is referring to the Wolf of the North. So yeah, you could say it's cold.","nextNodeIds":[705090113]},{"nodeId":705090113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1045,"speakerName":"Shenhe","textMapHash":3170854250,"text":"Caramel Pinecone... How could that be a drink?","nextNodeIds":[705090114]},{"nodeId":705090114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3838909506,"text":"Oh, Paimon's tried that one. It's actually caramel flavored coffee. \"Pinecone\" just refers to the color!","nextNodeIds":[705090115]},{"nodeId":705090115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1045,"speakerName":"Shenhe","textMapHash":231329618,"text":"Huh...","nextNodeIds":[705090116]},{"nodeId":705090116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1045,"speakerName":"Shenhe","textMapHash":2842793298,"text":"These names are confusing. I can't make sense of any of these.","nextNodeIds":[705090117]},{"nodeId":705090117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1045,"speakerName":"Shenhe","textMapHash":1151332682,"text":"I'll leave it up to you. As long as it's something that tastes like Qingxin or Violetgrass.","nextNodeIds":[705090118]},{"nodeId":705090118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2023283938,"text":"Those medicinal herbs don't grow around here. If you want something bitter, then it'd have to be coffee...","nextNodeIds":[705090119]},{"nodeId":705090119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3706512410,"text":"How about something sweet instead?","nextNodeIds":[705090120]},{"nodeId":705090120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1045,"speakerName":"Shenhe","textMapHash":2467373890,"text":"Fine.","nextNodeIds":[705090121]},{"nodeId":705090121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2717099482,"text":"That's a good idea. You've practiced the adepti arts long enough. It's time for something new!","nextNodeIds":[705090122]},{"nodeId":705090122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3879037914,"text":"Let's make Shenhe a Snow-Covered Kiss! It sounds like a perfect fit for her.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7050901,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1068,50],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LEAVE_SCENE_RANGE","PPFLKMOMKAI":"Q7050204_Play"}],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1045"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":1068,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7050902,"order":4,"stepDescription":"Mix Shenhe the specified drink","stepDescTextMapHash":2196645132,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7050902,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["1045"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":1068,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[7050901],"talks":[{"talkId":7050901,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":[